# Brochure form → Google Apps Script
#
# 1. Upload Mesoprobe.pdf, Muprobe.pdf, NG80.pdf to the script owner's Google Drive
# 2. Paste scripts/google-apps-brochure.gs into script.google.com
# 3. Set APPROVE_SECRET + WEB_APP_URL (/exec only — not /dev, not Library)
# 4. Deploy → Web app (Execute as Me, Anyone) → New version
# 5. Paste the same /exec URL below and restart the site
#
# Flow: form → sales@ gets Approve → click → PDF attaches from Drive → emailed to lead
#
VITE_BROCHURE_SCRIPT_URL=
